<TITLE>Stone Chipping Noise Reduction Structure</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Rocker protectors are provided on standard grade models and side mudguards on G grade models, reducing the noise of sand thrown up by the tires striking the underside of the rocker area (chipping noise).</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>By providing rear wheel house liners, high-frequency road noise and the noise of sand thrown up by the tires striking the back of the wheel house (chipping noise) have been reduced.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
